1
00:00:06,332 --> 00:00:08,462
(Raj:)I'm actually glad Lucy had to work tonight.

2
00:00:08,667 --> 00:00:12,897
(Raj:)Saved me the awkward conversation about
how I was gonna be hanging with my bros.

3
00:00:13,973 --> 00:00:16,843
(Howard:)Isn't every conversation you two
have awkward? Heh.

4
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:22,270
(Raj:)Painfully so. We have this rule on the phone
that if no one talks for three minutes...

5
00:00:22,448 --> 00:00:23,608
(Raj:)...you can just hang up.

6
00:00:26,118 --> 00:00:27,778
I'm so into her.

7
00:00:28,854 --> 00:00:31,794
- Ready whenever you guys are.
- Yeah, we'll be right there.

8
00:00:32,158 --> 00:00:33,178
(Sheldon:)- Leonard.
- Yeah?

9
00:00:33,425 --> 00:00:37,755
(Sheldon:)I'm not sure how I feel about Howard
being Dungeon Master instead of you.

10
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:41,330
Aw. That's nice, but relax,
sometimes change is good.

11
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,260
(Leonard:)You were worried about Zachary Quinto
being the new Spock...

12
00:00:44,436 --> 00:00:45,666
(Leonard:)...but you wound up liking him.

13
00:00:45,871 --> 00:00:49,971
(Sheldon:)Please. Every time the topic of change comes
up you throw Zachary Quinto in my face.

14
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:54,010
(Sheldon:)I'm upset the mailman has a new haircut,
"Zachary Quinto."

15
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:57,320
(Sheldon:)I'm upset that daylight saving time started,
"Zachary Quinto."

16
00:00:57,483 --> 00:00:59,853
(Sheldon:)Daylight saving time ended,
"Zachary Quinto."

17
00:01:00,186 --> 00:01:05,026
(Sheldon:)For the last time, Zachary Quinto
was a weird, wonderful, unrepeatable event.

